es not visit the cow\" false. So, the correct answer is B) False.\n\nYes, that's correct.\n</think>\n\nThe bear is young and blue, so it visits the mouse. Visiting the mouse leads to visiting the cow. Therefore, the bear does visit the cow, making the statement \"The bear does not visit the cow\" false.\n\n**Answer: B) False**",
